    "Use a compatible HTTP endpoint and choose its protocol once. Model IDs can be added after saving.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Use a compatible HTTP endpoint and choose its protocol once. Model IDs can be added after saving."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "使用兼容的 HTTP 端点并选择一次协议。保存后可以添加模型 ID。"}}}},
